      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-DARK-NPC19-E_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "That is way too complicated for me. But if Terra is on it and safe, fine. We hit a new snag.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/TurtleFanatic_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Phobus_Anchorite_AH-DARK_094.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1756160,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-DARK-NPC19-E_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Another wall of debris in our way. The Troopers and Shellions set up some bombshells, but they were chased out by those pink things.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Turtle_NomadF_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Phillis_Windstone_AH-DARK_050.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1756151,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-DARK-NPC19-E_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "And apparently, they left a trail of ink or something behind them, so we can't see anything.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Turtle_NomadF_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Phillis_Windstone_AH-DARK_051.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1756151,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-DARK-NPC19-E_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But you have spells to help with that, things to track the bombshells in the cloud and reveal the ones so obscured they might as well be invisible.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/TurtleFanatic_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Phobus_Anchorite_AH-DARK_095.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1756160,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-DARK-NPC19-E_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Exactly. The Troopers lined that tunnel with bombs, so head in, use your magic to find and arm the bombshells, then blow up the debris.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Turtle_NomadF_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Phillis_Windstone_AH-DARK_052.mp3",
